[statement]
A package installed answers a dependency of a package the request installs,
at its own version, though nothing in the world names it: `lib` 1.0 stays,
rather than being removed or upgraded.

[repository]
P:lib
V:1.0-r0

P:lib
V:2.0-r0

P:foo
V:1.0-r0
D:lib

[installed]
P:lib
V:1.0-r0

[request]
foo

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install foo 1.0-r0
